1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,119
Estimates go out, the crew gets busy, and nobody follows up.

2
00:00:04,569 --> 00:00:12,270
In this sample, for an invented remodeling company, seven estimates had gone quiet, worth over $92,000.

3
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:15,003
Each one gets a suggested next step.

4
00:00:15,253 --> 00:00:21,183
An estimate sent seventy seven days ago is flagged to confirm whether to re-quote, with no draft.

5
00:00:21,633 --> 00:00:26,604
The others get a follow-up draft naming the job and estimate number, for you to send.

6
00:00:26,854 --> 00:00:28,454
Drafts never change your price.

